  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>You barely manage to turn away in time to save your face, but the massive impact of thermal energy still partly cooks your brain inside your skull.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Gain @Condition[Unconscious]. Roll once on the @Table[mutatemental] Table when you wake up. This does not lose you any Corruption Points nor does it count towards your Corruption Limit. You also suffer a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.kKccDTGzWzSXCBOb]{Festering Wound} and will never regrow your head hair, suffering a penalty of -10 to your Fellowship whenever the exposed bone of your skull becomes obvious.</p>"
    },
